{"id":"37d9185b1af2ab3e","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-zfc-ordinal-definable-set.md","title":"ZFC Ordinal Definable Set","display":"df-zfc-ordinal-definable-set — ZFC Ordinal Definable Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-ordinal-definable-set","aliases":["58-df-zfc-ordinal-definable-set"],"display":"df-zfc-ordinal-definable-set — ZFC Ordinal Definable Set","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-v-alpha.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-ordinal-definable-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-ordinal-definable-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-ordinal-definable-set — ZFC Ordinal Definable Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"aabdf3005231e9dc\" href=\"?note=aabdf3005231e9dc\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-v-alpha.md\">../batch12/58-df-v-alpha.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md\">../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in V\">\\(x\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak V_\\theta\">\\(\\mathfrak V_\\theta\\)</span> is the canonical membership structure on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_\\theta\">\\(V_\\theta\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"aabdf3005231e9dc\" href=\"?note=aabdf3005231e9dc\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-v-alpha.md\">../batch12/58-df-v-alpha.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\{\\in\\})\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\{\\in\\})\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models\">\\(\\models\\)</span> are the ordinal, formula, and satisfaction notions (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md\">../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OrdinalDefinableSet}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{OrdinalDefinableSet}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}definable\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{OrdinalDefinableSet}_S(x) \\leftrightarrow \\exists\\theta,n,\\bar\\alpha,\\varphi\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\theta)\\land n\\in\\omega\\land\\bar\\alpha\\in\\theta^n\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\{\\in\\})\\land x\\in V_\\theta\\land\\mathfrak V_\\theta\\models\\varphi[x,\\bar\\alpha]\\land\\forall y\\in V_\\theta\\;(\\mathfrak V_\\theta\\models\\varphi[y,\\bar\\alpha]\\to y=x)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}definable\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{OrdinalDefinableSet}_S(x) \\leftrightarrow \\exists\\theta,n,\\bar\\alpha,\\varphi\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\theta)\\land n\\in\\omega\\land\\bar\\alpha\\in\\theta^n\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\{\\in\\})\\land x\\in V_\\theta\\land\\mathfrak V_\\theta\\models\\varphi[x,\\bar\\alpha]\\land\\forall y\\in V_\\theta\\;(\\mathfrak V_\\theta\\models\\varphi[y,\\bar\\alpha]\\to y=x)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Truth is evaluated in a set-sized rank initial segment, avoiding an illicit satisfaction predicate for the proper class <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-v-alpha.md","status":"resolved","id":"aabdf3005231e9dc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-v-alpha.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-4